ReShiki's checked Rust traversal sort policies adapt these standard-library
algorithms to preserve the pinned chemistry reference's equal-key ordering:

LLVM libc++ __algorithm/sort.h and heap primitives, read from the Apple
MacOSX26.2 SDK. Part of the LLVM Project.
https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/tree/llvmorg-20.1.8/libcxx/include/__algorithm
Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception; see llvm-LICENSE.

Microsoft C++ Standard Library algorithm header, MSVC 14.43.34808.
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.
https://github.com/microsoft/STL/tree/vs-2022-17.13/stl/inc
Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception; see msvc-LICENSE.

Adaptations are in src/chemistry/smiles/traversal/apple_sort.rs and
windows_sort.rs. They use integer keys, fallible indexing and explicit stacks.
